+
+## Function/equational rules
+
+| # | Source | Equation | Static assessment |
+|---:|---|---|---|
+| 19 | `semantic.k:115` | `lookupPy` finds a unique map binding. | Correct because K maps have unique keys; missing keys stay stuck. |
